<title>POLAND: RELPOL 96 NET RISES TO PLN 5.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL 96 NET RISES TO PLN 5.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.36 vs   0.01 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.88 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.39 vs   0.20</p>
<p> Sales		    2.66 vs   2.63</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.55 vs   4.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.77 vs   6.46</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.61 vs   7.37</p>
<p> Sales		   38.30 vs  38.54</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electromagnetic maker is Relpol</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
